    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀγκ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγκος</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bulky,
				swollen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα</span>”
