					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ, εἰς τὸ ἄνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Art.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stately, pompous,</i>
			
